      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0518004d4c455bed3907d68c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……话虽如此，仅仅一个装傻就能让她笑成这样，也是挺少见的。\n为了留作以后的参考，我从包里拿出了笔记本，打算记下来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdf4c221fa3ecd4b9db8565a5f5c8accda5e90f96b0ca391c8d9f819c7503e75",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1130/storytimeline_041130007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10970b8769163813d3685042",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊啊，素材已经攒了不少了",
      "source_fingerprint": "af3b0a484b733b379d316f9d863ea8485d90f429c1a4f1b0c993a75ba06b5491",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
