      "uid": "zhcn:67efbaa99cd1e8bcc1450b29",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能回应您的，就只有我了。请放心，\n您的装傻我全都懂，我会即兴给您吐槽的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "442974ffc4a311555b1b192a9b6a9c65acf77da501042b85dadc2790ee1565bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1130/storytimeline_041130007.json",
      "json_path": [
