      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "发展实在太过迅速，我的大脑有些跟不上。\n但是，看到她对吐槽这么干劲十足，我也很高兴——",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b2f520dc2c2854dcb5e63be69a09a729b89998bf9f08eeed4f02021c6244279",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
