      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "被旺紫丁牵着手，我们向沙滩深处走去。\n在空无一人的海边，仅限今晚的舞台开幕了——",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dec46a2ce531db1f7a077f3b60dbb824d96beeb6841689a5686e64b1f4292aa",
